OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA sunny start, but cloud
OL,6,Ftending to increase throughout the
OL,7,Fmorning, limiting the sunshine. A few
OL,8,Fshowers also developing come the
OL,9,Fafternoon, possibly heavy in places.
OL,10,FFeeling a little cooler.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FApart
OL,13,Ffrom a few showers, the weekend will
OL,14,Fbe largely dry with some sunshine. A
OL,15,Fband of rain then likely to move in
OL,16,Fduring Monday. Temperatures nearer to
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
